valid methods of interaction even for someone rigorously selfish
and logical.  (Check out "The Right to be Greedy" on Loompanics Press
for a screed about this possibility carried to the ultimate extreme.
C(c)ommunism as the ultimate expression of selfishness?  You bet.  
